msgid "Operating Analysis"
msgstr "公司经营分析"

msgid "Company-wide analysis"
msgstr "公司整体分析"

msgid "Official invoices, factory purchase orders and registered administrative expenses."
msgstr "基于正式医院发票、工厂采购单与已登记行政支出。"

msgid "Back to financial actuals"
msgstr "返回财务实绩"

msgid "Reporting month"
msgstr "统计月份"

msgid "Apply"
msgstr "筛选"

msgid "Company-wide EUR estimates based on currently registered documents and expenses. VAT, income tax, depreciation, bank charges, unrecorded costs and accounting period adjustments may not be fully covered."
msgstr "公司整体 EUR 经营估算基于当前已登记单据和费用，可能未完整覆盖增值税、所得税、折旧、银行手续费、未登记成本和会计期间调整。"

msgid "Sales and purchases use account issue dates; administrative expenses use expense dates. Cash flow uses transaction payment dates and administrative payment dates, including payments for earlier months."
msgstr "销售和采购按结算账户开立日期统计，行政支出按费用发生日期统计；现金流按流水付款日期和行政费用付款日期统计，包含以前月份费用的本月付款。"

msgid "Administrative payment status is manually registered. The cash flow estimate is not a bank-reconciled cash balance. Administrative expenses are not allocated to hospitals or orders."
msgstr "行政费用付款状态为人工登记；净现金流估算不代表经银行对账的现金余额。行政支出不分摊到医院或订单。"

