msgid "Frozen formal settlement amounts. Account issue dates and party filters define the account selection; cash flow includes posted transactions belonging to those accounts, grouped by payment date."
msgstr "使用正式结算账户冻结金额。开立日期和医院、工厂等筛选条件决定账户范围；现金统计包含这些账户的有效流水，并按付款日期分组。"

msgid "Estimated operating balance is not formal after-tax net profit. Taxes, depreciation, bank charges and unregistered expenses may not be fully covered."
msgstr "预计经营结余不等于正式税后净利润，税费、折旧、银行手续费和未登记费用可能尚未完整覆盖。"

